			"Message": "chore(Cocoon): Standardize whitespace in codegen and update telemetry identifiers\n\nReplace hardcoded tab escape sequences (`\\t`) with literal tab characters in `Source/Codegen/Emit/Emit/Ext/Host/Schema.ts` to ensure consistent formatting in generated TypeScript definitions. Correct a regression in `Source/Platform/Environment.ts` where `\\temp` was accidentally converted to a tab character, restoring the correct Windows temporary directory path.\n\nUpdate default environment identifiers to use the internal project codename `fiddee` in `Source/Services/Handler/VscodeAPI/Env/Namespace.ts`, replacing generic `land` values for `appName` and `machineId`. Align the PostHog telemetry configuration in `Source/Telemetry/PostHog/Event.ts` by changing the `$app` property to `fiddee`.\n\nRebuild all `Target/` artifacts to synchronize the compiled JavaScript bundles, source maps, and the `RouteManifest` generation timestamp with these source changes.",
